<%# Shown to signed-in visitors who aren't in the Discord server yet — on the
    guild page, the team page, and after a submit. Applying works without
    joining (that's the recruiting flow); this banner makes the one remaining
    requirement loud: join the server, or an acceptance can't add you. %>
<div class="rounded-xl border border-gold/40 bg-gold/5 p-5">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-foreground">You're not in the Discord server yet</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        You can apply to <span class="text-foreground"><%= guild.name %></span>'s teams right now —
        but you'll need to join the server on Discord to be added to a team when you're accepted.
      </p>
      <% if guild.invite_url.blank? %>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          This server hasn't set up an invite link — ask a server admin for an invite.
        </p>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <% if guild.invite_url.present? %>
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <%= render Ui::ButtonComponent.new(href: guild.invite_url, variant: :gold) do %>
          Join <%= guild.name %> on Discord
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
